JYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Coffee & Tea, Food","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"r-EldXbu3BcEPGudSu0EZA","review_id":"JIgDXflokWUh0jhgY-6ICw","date":"2019-12-02T14:06:51","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9344398975372314,"text_excerpt":"Interesting menu choices, good prices, quick service, and delicious coffee. There's not usually a line in the morning, which is a bonus in comparison to other locations. Service is always great. Auction House is mostly empty in the early morning hours, so you can enjoy the beautiful atmosphere in silence - very unusual in comparison to the hustle and bustle of afternoon here. Although still in the afternoon the service is quick and they have a lot of fun options afternoon coffee. I like regular lattes, and they're perfectly roasted, frothed, and ready to drink (not too hot which is super important to me)."},{"business_id":"r-EldXbu3BcEPGudSu0EZA","review_id":"Xe4BFVSujnMwwQ791lFNbg","date":"2021-03-25T00:59:45","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.8941407799720764,"text_excerpt":"My daughter and I were walking around the area and stumbled on Coast Roast. This location is really nice. You can purchase quite a few things inside including coffee, pens, and Coast Roast merch. I love the inside and the outdoor seating is perfect for a sunny day. We grabbed two hot chai lattes and enjoyed some quality sun and people watching.. This place now holds the crown for our favorite chai latte. This is the perfect spot to grab a drink while enjoying the many shops within walking distance."},{"business_id":"r-EldXbu3BcEPGudSu0EZA","review_id":"S8a27EVehPBl1AQvHTnZbw","date":"2019-05-12T21:32:02","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.8881081342697144,"text_excerpt":"Small shop located INSIDE Auction House Market - we walked right by it twice. You have to go inside to see a group of small businesses in a market-like setting. Try the Randazzo's blueberry pie with iced tea. A nice little afternoon snack. YUM!!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"r-EldXbu3BcEPGudSu0EZA","photo_id":"_CgL3I1yxcUvdfKffAyUbA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/_CgL3I1yxcUvdfKffAyUbA.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0}]},"notebook_case":null}
